{
 "source": "geneva",
 "book": "1CH",
 "chapter": 12,
 "units": [
  {
   "id": "geneva/1CH.12.1",
   "range": "1CH.12.1",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "9e7bacf9",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/1CH.12.1#p1-9e7bacf9",
     "text": "To take his part against Saul: who persecuted him.",
     "label": "a",
     "anchor": "Ziklag"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/1CH.12.2",
   "range": "1CH.12.2",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "1dc60e71",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/1CH.12.2#p1-1dc60e71",
     "text": "That is, of the tribe of Benjamin, of which Saul was, and in which were excellent throwers with slings, Jud 20:16.",
     "label": "b",
     "anchor": "brethren of Benjamin",
     "refs": [
      {
       "text": "Jud 20:16",
       "ref": "JDG.20.16"
      }
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/1CH.12.8",
   "range": "1CH.12.8",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "deb096c0",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/1CH.12.8#p1-deb096c0",
     "text": "Meaning, fierce and terrible.",
     "label": "c",
     "anchor": "lions"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/1CH.12.15",
   "range": "1CH.12.15",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "179d4586",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/1CH.12.15#p1-179d4586",
     "text": "Which the Hebrews called Nisan, or Abib, containing half March and half April, when Jordan was wont to overflow its banks, read Jos 3:15.",
     "label": "d",
     "anchor": "first month",
     "refs": [
      {
       "text": "Jos 3:15",
       "ref": "JOS.3.15"
      }
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/1CH.12.18",
   "range": "1CH.12.18",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "47105b43",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/1CH.12.18#p1-47105b43",
     "text": "The spirit of boldness and courage moved him to speak thus.",
     "label": "e",
     "anchor": "spirit came upon Amasai"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/1CH.12.19",
   "range": "1CH.12.19",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "84c5068a",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/1CH.12.19#p1-84c5068a",
     "text": "They came only to help David, and not to help the Philistines, who were enemies of their country.",
     "label": "f",
     "anchor": "helped them not"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/1CH.12.21",
   "range": "1CH.12.21",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "8fdd5c0d",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/1CH.12.21#p1-8fdd5c0d",
     "text": "That is, of the Amalekites who had burned the city of Ziklag, 1Sa 30:1,9.",
     "label": "g",
     "anchor": "band of the rovers",
     "refs": [
      {
       "text": "1Sa 30:1,9",
       "ref": "1SA.30.1"
      },
      {
       "text": "1Sa 30:1,9",
       "ref": "1SA.30.9"
      }
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/1CH.12.22",
   "range": "1CH.12.22",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "c9f26619",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/1CH.12.22#p1-c9f26619",
     "text": "Meaning, mighty or strong, for the Hebrews say a thing is of God when it is excellent.",
     "label": "h",
     "anchor": "God"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/1CH.12.27",
   "range": "1CH.12.27",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "d6052560",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/1CH.12.27#p1-d6052560",
     "text": "Of the Levites who came by the descent of Aaron.",
     "label": "i",
     "anchor": "Aaronites"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/1CH.12.29",
   "range": "1CH.12.29",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "0b3f9506",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/1CH.12.29#p1-0b3f9506",
     "text": "That is, the greatest number took Saul's side.",
     "label": "k",
     "anchor": "kept the ward of the house"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/1CH.12.32",
   "range": "1CH.12.32",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "67894ead",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/1CH.12.32#p1-67894ead",
     "text": "Men of good experience, who knew at all times what was to be done.",
     "label": "l",
     "anchor": "times"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/1CH.12.38",
   "range": "1CH.12.38",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "6408b05f",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/1CH.12.38#p1-6408b05f",
     "text": "So that his whole host were 322,222.",
     "label": "m",
     "anchor": "All these men of war"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/1CH.12.39",
   "range": "1CH.12.39",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "ba618e4c",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/1CH.12.39#p1-ba618e4c",
     "text": "The rest of the Israelites.",
     "label": "n",
     "anchor": "brethren had prepared for them"
    }
   ]
  }
 ]
}
